{"id": "064_janet_05|janet-05-start|L2", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« They’re extremists. Totally crazy. »", "passage": "janet-05-start", "speaker": "JANET", "es": "« Son extremistas. Están completamente locos. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false, "hint": "«Son extremistas. Está completamente loco».", "hint_origin": "direct"}
{"id": "064_janet_05|janet-05-start|L3", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Some try to get ahold of anything remotely technological only to destroy it. »", "passage": "janet-05-start", "speaker": "JANET", "es": "« Algunos tratan de conseguir cualquier cosa remotamente tecnológica solo para destruirla. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false, "hint": "«Hay quienes intentan apoderarse de algo remotamente tecnológico solo para destruirlo».", "hint_origin": "direct"}
{"id": "064_janet_05|janet-05-start|L4", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« They’ve gathered heaps of screens, keyboards, lamps… to burn them. »", "passage": "janet-05-start", "speaker": "JANET", "es": "« Juntaron montañas de pantallas, teclados, lámparas… para quemarlas. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false, "hint": "«Reunieron un montón de pantallas, teclados, lámparas… para quemarlos.»", "hint_origin": "direct"}
{"id": "064_janet_05|janet-05-start|L6", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« The fires last for days. The sky… »", "passage": "janet-05-start", "speaker": "JANET", "es": "« Los incendios duran días. El cielo… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false, "hint": "«Los incendios duran varios días. El cielo…»", "hint_origin": "aligned+verified"}
{"id": "064_janet_05|janet-05-start|L7", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Some days, the sky is filled with toxic soot. Black ash… »", "passage": "janet-05-start", "speaker": "JANET", "es": "« Algunos días, el cielo se llena de hollín tóxico. Ceniza negra… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false, "hint": "«A veces, el cielo se llena de hollín tóxico. El fresno negro…»", "hint_origin": "direct"}
{"id": "064_janet_05|janet-05-start|L8", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "She shrugs.", "passage": "janet-05-start", "es": "Se encoge de hombros.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false, "hint": "Ella se encoge de hombros.", "hint_origin": "aligned+verified"}
{"id": "064_janet_05|janet-05-start|L9", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« I’m lucky, I guess. I can remember what it was like before… The children, though… »", "passage": "janet-05-start", "speaker": "JANET", "es": "« Tengo suerte, supongo. Puedo recordar cómo era antes… Los niños, en cambio… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false, "hint": "«Creo que tuve suerte. Recuerdo cómo era antes… Pero los niños…»", "hint_origin": "direct"}
{"id": "064_janet_05|janet-05-start|L10", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« I feel most sorry for them… They’re so lifeless… sad. »", "passage": "janet-05-start", "speaker": "JANET", "es": "« Ellos son los que más me dan pena… Están tan sin vida… tan tristes. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false, "hint": "«Son los que más me dan lástima… Se ven tan apagados… y tristes.»", "hint_origin": "aligned+verified"}
{"id": "064_janet_05|janet-05-start|L12", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "She looks at you.", "passage": "janet-05-start", "es": "Te mira.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false, "hint": "Ella los está mirando.", "hint_origin": "aligned+verified"}
{"id": "064_janet_05|janet-05-start|L13", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« You looked surprised, but… »", "passage": "janet-05-start", "speaker": "JANET", "es": "« Te veías sorprendido, pero… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false, "hint": "«Te veías sorprendido, pero…»", "hint_origin": "direct"}
{"id": "064_janet_05|janet-05-future1|L1", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "The image of her flickers, shakes. She raises her head to speak to someone… someone outside the cab.", "passage": "janet-05-future1", "es": "Su imagen titila, tiembla. Levanta la cabeza para hablar con alguien… alguien afuera del taxi.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false, "hint": "Su imagen se ve borrosa, tembla. Ella levanta la cabeza para hablar con alguien… con alguien que está afuera del taxi.", "hint_origin": "direct"}
{"id": "064_janet_05|janet-05-future1|L3", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« What? They’re getting closer? »", "passage": "janet-05-future1", "speaker": "JANET", "es": "« ¿Qué? ¿Se están acercando? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false, "hint": "«¿Qué? ¿Se están acercando?»", "hint_origin": "verified"}
{"id": "064_janet_05|janet-05-future1|L4", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« I don’t know if I can stay much longer. »", "passage": "janet-05-future1", "speaker": "JANET", "es": "« No sé si puedo quedarme mucho más. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false, "hint": "«No sé si podré quedarme mucho tiempo.»", "hint_origin": "direct"}
