{"id": "064_janet_05|janet-05-future1|L6", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« A few days ago, we got our hands on some newspapers from your time. »", "passage": "janet-05-future1", "speaker": "JANET", "es": "« Hace unos días, conseguimos algunos periódicos de tu época. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false, "hint": "«Hace unos días nos llegaron a las manos varios periódicos de su época».", "hint_origin": "direct"}
{"id": "064_janet_05|janet-05-future1|L8", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "She looks down.", "passage": "janet-05-future1", "es": "Baja la mirada.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false, "hint": "\"\"Solo quería... decirles... que puedo pagar\".\"", "hint_origin": "direct"}
{"id": "064_janet_05|janet-05-future1|L9", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Everything we read seemed… trivial. »", "passage": "janet-05-future1", "speaker": "JANET", "es": "« Todo lo que leímos parecía… trivial. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false, "hint": "«Todo lo que leíamos nos parecía… trivial.»", "hint_origin": "direct"}
{"id": "064_janet_05|janet-05-future1|L10", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« And it felt so good. We laughed about it, even though deep down… »", "passage": "janet-05-future1", "speaker": "JANET", "es": "« Y se sintió tan bien. Nos reímos de eso, aunque en el fondo… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false, "hint": "«Y fue tan lindo. Nos reíamos de eso, aunque en el fondo…»", "hint_origin": "direct"}
{"id": "064_janet_05|janet-05-future1|L11", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« I miss those debates, stories, the editorials… »", "passage": "janet-05-future1", "speaker": "JANET", "es": "« Extraño esos debates, esas historias, los editoriales… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false, "hint": "«Extraño esos debates, esas historias, esos artículos de opinión…»", "hint_origin": "verified"}
